  "speaker_source_detail": "diarize library (15 speakers) + local Whisper transcription",
  "start": 3217.9,
  "end": 3240.9,
  "text": "Council member Bates. Council member Berb and McQuillan. Aye. Motion passed unanimously. We will go on to the public hearings. Our first public hearings, a public hearing on the Chamberidge Road, Eaten Place, Intersection Improvement Project. This is a no council action item. We will recognize Wendy Sanford, Transportation Director to provide the staff presentation."
