  "text": "Can you speak more about some of these concerns from a safety perspective because that's the primary concern for me. So maybe educate us a little bit more about not only just the design considerations but the safety impact. So for example with the statistic about 99 crashes at the D level and moving to the C level for example what is that different from a safety perspective."
