  "text": "The only thing I would add to that is when it comes to delay as an intersection degrade and levels of service and delay as you wait longer drivers get more anxious or aggressive they are willing to get past that you know you are going to wait a minute and a half but that next signal to come around for you to get through you are more likely to push the envelope that yellow that red so we are trying to address safety in two ways reduction of conflict points removing the opportunity for vehicles interact with each other and if we can reduce the delay and reduce the conduct congestion that will reduce driver anxiety driver frustration and help get through the intersection faster and be more willing to adhere to the operations at the"
